# Everything listed here is excluded from the BUILD CONTEXT: the files Docker sends to the daemon
# (and so from `COPY . .` in the build stage). Smaller context = faster builds, and nothing secret
# or irrelevant can end up in an image layer.

# Installed and built inside the image from package-lock.json: a copy from your machine could be
# for another operating system, or stale.
node_modules/
dist/

# Secrets and local config: must never end up in an image
.env
.env.*
*.local
*.pem

# Not needed to build
coverage/
.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
CLAUDE.md
*.md
